     1966   PROCEDURE U-LINE :
     1967   UNDERLINE stream OutStream
     1968           sym1
     1969           f-fact-date
     1970           sym2
     1971           f-doc-code
     1972           sym3
     1973           f-cli-name
     1974           sym4
     1975           f-qnty
     1976           sym5
     1977           f-SumWithNDS
     1978           sym6
     1979           f-SumWithoutNDS
     1980           sym7
     1981           f-discnt-sum
     1982           sym8
     1983           f-ov-sum
     1984           sym9
     1985           f-sale-sum
     1986           sym10
     1987           f-VAT_pc
     1988           sym11
     1989           f-VAT-Sum
     1990           sym12
     1991           f-SLT_pc
     1992           sym13
     1993           f-SLT-sum
     1994           sym14
     1995           with FRAME DocsRep .
     1996           DOWN stream  OutStream 1 with FRAME DocsRep.
